OL,3,GNEWSAMetal detector find sparks bomb
OL,4,Adisposal call
OL,5,
OL,6,FA metal detector enthusiast who feared
OL,7,Fshe had unearthed a potentially
OL,8,Fdangerous object was helped by a bomb
OL,9,Fdisposal team in Surrey.
OL,11,FAngela Anderson found the "rusty
OL,12,Ftoadstool-looking" item near her home
OL,13,Fin Ash Vale and handed it to her son
OL,14,FTony Anderson at the family's car
OL,15,Fdealership on Wednesday.
OL,17,FThey uploaded an image of the object to
OL,18,Fa generative AI chatbot, which flagged
OL,19,Fit could be a shell fuze and told them
OL,20,Fto contact emergency services, the
OL,21,Ffamily told BBC Radio Surrey.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
